{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17139","headline":"宿裴友书斋 · 李观","name":"宿裴友书斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卧君山窗下，山鸟与我言。\n清风何飕飀，松栢中夜繁。\n久游失归趣，宿此似故园。\n林烟横近郊，谿月落古原。\n穉子不待晓，花间出柴门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李观","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17139.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17139","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}